      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jamesburg%2C_New_Jersey",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Jamesburg's history includes a notable school funded by Buckelew, which was open to all children regardless of race.",
